  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      190.05,
      215.93,
      373.76,
      240.83
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI SHAKYASINHARAMAVIHARASTHA KARYASADHAKA SANVIDANAYA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      256.49,
      401.89,
      321.83
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Organization called and known as the\u201cSri Shakyasinharama Viharastha KaryasadhakaSanvidanaya\u201d has heretofore been created for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Organization:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      337.49,
      401.9,
      402.83
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Organization has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters of the Organization and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      418.49,
      401.89,
      443.27
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      458.93,
      401.87,
      497.27
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Sri ShakyasinharamaViharastha Karyasadhaka Sanvidanaya (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      512.93,
      401.91,
      672.83
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as presently are members of the\u201cSri Shakyasinharama Viharastha KaryasadhakaSanvidanaya\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAssociation\u201d)or shall hereafter be admitted as members of the Corporationhereby constituted, shall be a body corporate (hereinafterreferred to as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d) with perpetual successionunder the name and style of the \u201cSri ShakyasinharamaViharastha Karyasadhaka Sanvidanaya\u201d and by that nameand may sue and be sued in all courts with full power andauthority to have and use a common seal and alter the sameat its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      408.81,
      257.59,
      443.25,
      266.66
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
