    ],
    "text": "5.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall subject to therules in force for the time being of the Corporation, beadministered by a Board of Management appointed inaccordance with the rules of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
