      255.05,
      397.18,
      279.47
    ],
    "text": "(2) The accounts of the Corporation shall be auditedannually by the auditors appointed by the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      294.29,
      397.2,
      318.71
    ],
    "text": "(3) The financial year of the Corporation shall be from 1stof January to 31st December of every year.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
